  "In a 2019 study of 53,000 product pages and 11,000 websites, researchers found that about one in 10 employs these design practices.": "在2019年对53,000个产品页面和11,000个网站的研究中，研究人员发现大约十分之一采用了这些设计做法。",
  "Immersive reading, by contrast, depends on being willing to risk inefficiency, goallessness, even time-wasting.": "相比之下，沉浸式阅读取决于愿意承担低效率、无目标甚至浪费时间风险的态度。",
