  "The forestry and wood trade body has called for urgent action to reduce the country's reliance on timber imports and provide a stable supply of wood for future generations.": "林业和木材贸易机构呼吁采取紧急行动，以减少国家对木材进口的依赖，并为子孙后代提供稳定的木材供应。",
