  "West Virginia, the practice of selecting so-called elite or blue-ribbon juries provided a convenient way around this and other antidiscrimination laws.": "在西弗吉尼亚州，挑选所谓的精英或蓝带陪审团的做法为绕过这一法律和其他反歧视法律提供了便捷途径。",
