  "Simmons was under fire for having sat on Goldman’s compensation committee; how could she have let those enormous bonus payouts pass unremarked?": "西蒙斯因曾担任高盛薪酬委员会成员而受到抨击；她怎么能让那些巨额奖金支出悄无声息地通过呢？",
