  "The apartments in the elegant towers Mies built on Chicago’s Lake Shore Drive, for example, were smaller—two-bedroom units under 1,000 square feet—than those in their older neighbors along the city’s Gold Coast.": "例如，密斯在芝加哥湖滨大道上建造的优雅塔楼中的公寓——两居室单元不到1000平方英尺——比该市黄金海岸沿线较老邻居的公寓还要小。",
  "Nothing is necessarily gained by forcing students to learn geometry at a graffitied desk stuck with generations of discarded chewing gum.": "强迫学生在满是涂鸦、粘着几代人嚼过的口香糖的课桌上学习几何，未必能带来什么好处。",
