  "The cost of solar panels has dropped by 80 percent and the cost of wind turbines by close to one-third in the past eight years.": "在过去八年中，太阳能电池板的成本下降了80%，风力涡轮机的成本下降了近三分之一。",
  "This summer, as you enjoy your favorite neighborhood street festival, I hope you’ll remember that they exist because of community support.": "今年夏天，当你在享受最喜欢的社区街头节日时，我希望你记住，它们的存在是因为社区的支持。",
