  "We unconsciously associate fast food with speed and impatience and carry those impulses into whatever else we're doing.": "我们无意识地将快餐与速度和急躁联系在一起，并将这些冲动带入我们所做的其他任何事情中。",
  "There is no experimental evidence showing that it interferes with our ability to focus, for instance, wrote psychologists Christopher Chabris and Daniel J.": "例如，心理学家克里斯托弗·查布里斯和丹尼尔·J.写道，没有实验证据表明它会干扰我们集中注意力的能力。",
  "The industry is betting that the same consumers paying more for premium attributes such as free- range, non-GMO, and pasture-raised eggs will embrace sustainability.": "该行业押注，那些为散养、非转基因和牧场饲养鸡蛋等优质属性支付更高价格的消费者将接受可持续性。",
  "Terms like unplug, offline, life-hack, bandwidth, and capacity are all about setting boundaries between the office and the home.": "像“拔掉插头”、“离线”、“生活窍门”、“带宽”和“容量”这样的术语，都是关于在办公室和家庭之间设定界限。",
  "It is hard to shove for attention among multibillion-pound infrastructure projects, so it is inevitable that the attention is focused elsewhere.": "在数十亿英镑的基础设施项目中，想要脱颖而出吸引关注十分困难，因此注意力不可避免地集中在其他地方。",
  "Against a backdrop of drastic changes in economy and population structure, younger Americans are drawing a new 21st-century road map to success, a latest poll has found.": "最新一项民调发现，在经济和人口结构剧烈变化的背景下，较年轻的美国人正在绘制一幅21世纪通往成功的新路线图。",
  "He is a teacher at a New Hampshire high school where learning is not something of books and tests and mechanical memorization, but practical.": "他是新罕布什尔州一所高中的老师，在那里，学习不是书本、考试和机械记忆，而是实践性的。",
  "DeSombre isn't saying people should stop caring about the environment.": "德索姆布雷并不是说人们应该停止关心环境。",
  "Young people who are still getting started in life were more likely than older adults to prioritize personal fulfillment in their work, to believe they will advance their careers most by regularly changing jobs, to favor communities with more public services and a faster pace of life, to agree that couples should be financially secure before getting married or having children, and to maintain that children are best served by two parents working outside the home, the survey found.": "调查发现，仍在人生起步阶段的年轻人比老年人更有可能在工作中优先考虑个人成就感，相信通过定期更换工作最能促进职业发展，偏爱公共服务更多、生活节奏更快的社区，同意夫妻在结婚或生育前应有经济保障，并认为孩子由双职工父母抚养最为有利。",
  "Intuition's special powers are unleashed only in certain circumstances.": "直觉的特殊力量只在特定情况下才会被释放。",
