  "Rather than have people simply rate their beauty compared with others, he asked them to identify an original photograph of themselves from a lineup including versions that had been altered to appear more and less attractive.": "他没有让人们简单地与他人比较来评价自己的美貌，而是要求他们从一组照片中辨认出自己的原始照片，其中包含经过修改、显得更美和更丑的版本。",
  "The younger they learn how computers think, how to coax the machine into producing what they want—the earlier they learn that they have the power to do that—the better.": "他们越早学会计算机如何思考、如何引导机器产生他们想要的东西——越早学会他们有能力做到这一点——就越好。",
  "Car and film reviewers have gone.": "汽车和电影评论员已经消失了。",
  "\"We've disconnected ourselves from living with fire,\" Balch says.": "巴尔奇说：“我们已经把自己与火共存的生活方式割裂开了。”",
  "In particular, they called for forging closer collaborations with western state governments, which are often uneasy with federal action, and with the private landowners who control an estimated 95% of the prairie chicken's habitat.": "特别是，他们呼吁与往往对联邦行动感到不安的西部各州政府以及控制着约95%草原松鸡栖息地的私人土地所有者建立更紧密的合作关系。",
  "When there is rapid improvement in the price and performance of technology, jobs that were once thought to be immune from automation suddenly become threatened.": "当技术的价格和性能迅速改善时，那些曾被认为不会受自动化影响的岗位突然面临威胁。",
