  "Everybody wants to know how the people who will soon inhabit those empty office cubicles will differ from those who came before them.": "每个人都想知道，那些即将入住那些空置办公隔间的人，与之前的人会有何不同。",
  "According to a report on UK food production from the University of Leeds, UK, 85 per cent of the country's total land area is associated with meat and dairy production.": "根据英国利兹大学一份关于英国食品生产的报告，英国总土地面积的85%与肉类和奶制品生产相关。",
  "The likelihood of being named in a federal class-action lawsuit also increases, and the stock is likely to perform worse.": "被列入联邦集体诉讼的可能性也会增加，股票表现也可能更差。",
  "One idea is that teenage behavior is related to what researchers call \"reward sensitivity.\" Decision-making always involves balancing rewards and risks, benefits and costs.": "一种观点认为，青少年的行为与研究人员所称的“奖赏敏感性”有关。决策总是涉及在奖赏与风险、收益与成本之间进行权衡。",
  "Meanwhile, the asocial robot simply moved forwards and backwards and side to side.": "与此同时，这个不合群的机器人只是前后左右移动。",
