  "\"It's a complete life-changer\" when someone stops—or is forced to stop— driving, said former risk manager Anne M.": "“当有人停止——或被强制停止——驾驶时，这完全改变了生活，”前风险管理人安妮·M说。",
  "California has been at the forefront of state privacy efforts with the California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018.": "加州凭借2018年的《加州消费者隐私法案》一直处于州级隐私保护工作的前沿。",
  "Yet rather than empowering teachers to find what works best for their students, the policy imposes a flat, across-the-board rule.": "然而，该政策并非赋予教师权力去探索最适合学生的教学方法，而是强加了一条一刀切的统一规则。",
  "Before it ends, it will likely change the life course and character of a generation of young adults.": "在它结束之前，它很可能会改变一代年轻成年人的生活轨迹和性格。",
  "The Flatiron School, where people pay to learn programming, started as one of the many coding bootcamps that's become popular for adults looking for a career change.": "Flatiron学校，人们付费学习编程的地方，最初是众多编程训练营之一，这些训练营在寻求职业转变的成年人中变得流行起来。",
  "Some Congress members are trying to block the plan, and at least a dozen industry groups, four states, and three environmental groups are challenging it in federal court.": "一些国会议员正试图阻止该计划，至少有十几个行业团体、四个州和三个环保组织在联邦法院对其提出质疑。",
  "We might then begin to solve our immigration challenges.": "那样我们也许就能开始解决我们的移民挑战。",
  "Working with your hands is seen as almost a mark of inferiority.": "从事体力劳动几乎被视为低人一等的标志。",
  "Although electric cars are still a rarity on roads now, this massive investment could change the picture rapidly in coming years.": "尽管电动汽车目前在道路上仍然罕见，但这笔巨额投资可能在未来几年内迅速改变这一局面。",
  "As desire paths criss-cross through both physical and virtual landscapes, they stand as a proof of the collective insistence on forging unconventional routes and embracing the spirit of communal choice.": "随着欲望小径纵横交错于物理和虚拟景观之中，它们证明了集体坚持开辟非常规路线并拥抱共同选择精神的力量。",
  "Yet this understanding is outdated.": "然而，这种理解已经过时了。",
  "Yet it is principally during this period of stronger governance that CEO pay has been high and   rising.": "然而，CEO薪酬居高不下且持续上涨，主要正是在这种更强治理的时期。",
  "Such improvements \"allow our hens to forage for higher-quality natural feed that will be good for the land, the hens, and the eggs that we supply to our customers.\" The egg industry's push is the first major test of whether animal products from regenerative farms can become the next premium offering.": "这些改进“让我们的母鸡能够觅食更高质量的天然饲料，这对土地、母鸡以及我们供应给客户的鸡蛋都有好处。”蛋品行业的这一推动是检验再生农场生产的动物产品能否成为下一个高端产品的首次重大考验。",
  "If appropriate public policies were in place to help all women—whether CEOs or their children's caregivers—and all families, Sandberg would be no more newsworthy than any other highly capable person living in a more just society.": "如果有适当的公共政策来帮助所有女性——无论是CEO还是她们孩子的看护者——以及所有家庭，那么桑德伯格就不会比生活在更公正社会中的任何其他杰出人士更具新闻价值。",
  "But it's not just a gender thing.": "但这不仅仅是性别问题。",
