  "Even as we humans count on forests to soak up a good share of the carbon dioxide we produce, we are threatening their ability to do so.": "即使我们人类指望森林吸收我们产生的大量二氧化碳，我们却在威胁它们履行这一职责的能力。",
  "With the blurring of roles, and the fact that the home front lags well behind the workplace in making adjustments for working women, it's not surprising that women are more stressed at home.": "由于角色的模糊，以及家庭方面在为职业女性做出调整方面远远落后于工作场所，女性在家里压力更大也就不足为奇了。",
  "Children aren't born knowing how to say \\\\\"I'm sorry\\\\\"; rather, they learn over time that such statements appease parents and friends—and their own consciences.": "孩子并非天生就知道如何说“对不起”；相反，他们随着时间推移才明白，这样的话能安抚父母和朋友——以及他们自己的良心。",
  "Overall, the idea is to let \\\\\"states remain in the driver's seat for managing the species,\\\\\" Ashe said.": "总体而言，这个想法是让“各州在管理物种方面保持主导地位”，阿什说。",
  "\"I still grew up in an upper middle-class home with parents who didn't have college degrees,\" Schneider said.": "“我仍然在一个中上层阶级家庭中长大，父母没有大学学位，”施奈德说。",
  "During the experiment, the social robot rat followed the living rats around, played with the same toys, and opened cage doors to let trapped rats escape.": "在实验过程中，社交机器人老鼠跟随活老鼠四处活动，玩同样的玩具，并打开笼门让被困的老鼠逃出。",
  "Restrictions that keep highly polluting cars out of certain areas—city centres, \"school streets\", even individual roads—are a response to the absence of a larger effort to properly enforce existing regulations and require auto companies to bring their vehicles into compliance.": "限制高污染汽车进入某些区域——市中心、“学校街道”，甚至个别道路——是对缺乏更大力度行动来有效执行现有法规并要求汽车公司使其车辆达标的一种回应。",
  "They had pushed the agency to designate the bird as \"endangered,\" a status that gives federal officials greater regulatory power to crack down on threats.": "他们曾敦促该机构将这种鸟列为“濒危物种”，这一地位赋予联邦官员更大的监管权力来打击威胁。",
  "However, the use of artificial grass must comply with the legal and policy safeguards in place to protect biodiversity and ensure sustainable drainage, while measures such as the strengthened biodiversity duty should serve to encourage public authorities to consider sustainable alternatives.\"": "然而，人造草坪的使用必须符合现有的法律和政策保障措施，以保护生物多样性并确保可持续排水，同时，加强生物多样性责任等措施应有助于鼓励公共机构考虑可持续的替代方案。",
