  "While the government's commitment to long-term funding may have changed, the very pressing need for more affordable housing is real and is not going away.": "尽管政府对长期资金的承诺可能已经改变，但对更负担得起的住房的迫切需求是真实存在的，并且不会消失。",
  "Sit down to read and the flywheel of work-related thoughts keeps spinning—or else you're so exhausted that a challenging book's the last thing you need.": "坐下来阅读时，与工作相关的思绪像飞轮一样不停转动——或者你已经筋疲力尽，一本有挑战性的书是你最不需要的东西。",
  "The percentage of retirement-age people in the labor force has doubled over the past three decades.": "过去三十年间，退休年龄人口在劳动力中的比例翻了一番。",
  "But completeness is no longer a virtue in the newspaper business.": "但完整性不再是报业的一种美德。",
  "And ultimately, it is likely to reshape our politics, our culture, and the character of our society for years.": "最终，它很可能在未来多年重塑我们的政治、文化和社会特征。",
  "In one study of the ability she called \\\\\"thin slicing,\\\\\" the late psychologist Nalini Ambady asked participants to watch silent 10-second video clips of professors and to rate the instructor's overall effectiveness.": "在一项关于她称之为“薄片切片”能力的研究中，已故心理学家纳利尼·安巴迪要求参与者观看教授们无声的10秒视频片段，并对教师整体教学效果进行评分。",
  "The fact is, unlike those large, city-produced music festivals, your neighborhood street festivals receive no city funding and rely on a combination of sponsorships, vendor fees and gate donations to cover their costs.": "事实是，与那些大型城市音乐节不同，你所在街区的街头节日不获得城市资金支持，而是依靠赞助、摊贩费用和门口捐款的组合来覆盖成本。",
  "In her latest book, Why Good People Do Bad Environmental Things,   Wellesley College professor Elizabeth R.": "在她最新著作《为什么好人会做破坏环境的坏事》中，韦尔斯利学院教授伊丽莎白·R.……",
  "The case may yet reach the Supreme Court.": "此案最终可能上诉至最高法院。",
