  "\\\\\"Tech is designed to really suck you in,\\\\\" says Jenny Radesky in her study of digital play, \\\\\"and digital products are there to promote maximal engagement.": "“科技的设计目的就是让你深陷其中，”珍妮·拉德斯基在她的数字游戏研究中说道，“数字产品就是为了促进最大程度的参与。”",
  "In other words, at a time when the working class has turned the country on its political head, frustrated that the opportunity that once defined America is vanishing, one obvious solution is staring us in the face.": "换句话说，当工人阶级因曾经定义美国的机会正在消失而感到沮丧、从而在政治上颠覆了这个国家时，一个显而易见的解决方案就摆在我们面前。",
  "Hagel says we have designed jobs in the U.S.": "哈格尔说，我们在美国设计的工作。",
