  "The   housing sector needs to accept that we are very unlikely to ever return to the era of large-scale public grants.": "住房部门需要接受这样一个事实：我们极不可能回到大规模公共拨款的时代。",
  "Older Americans are also the fastest-growing segment of the U.S. workforce.": "美国老年人也是美国劳动力中增长最快的群体。",
