  "To combat the trap of putting a premium on being busy, Cal Newport, author of Deep Work: Rules for Focused Success in a Distracted World, recommends building a habit of \\\\\"deep work\\\\\"—the ability to focus without distraction.": "为了克服将忙碌视为优先的陷阱，《深度工作：在分心世界中专注成功的规则》一书的作者卡尔·纽波特建议培养“深度工作”的习惯——即不受干扰地专注的能力。",
