  "Executives were violently agitated.": "高管们极度激动不安。",
  "This all seems random, but it's by design, part of what the $6.1 billion U.S.": "这一切看似随机，但却是设计好的，是美国61亿美元鸡蛋产业押注的下一个大事件的一部分。",
  "But while young and old mostly agree on what constitutes the finish line of a fulfilling life, they offer strikingly different paths for reaching it.": "但尽管年轻人和老年人在什么构成圆满人生的终点上大体一致，他们却提出了截然不同的实现路径。",
