  "Their teams of engineers stayed on, making them two of the many \"acqui-hires\" that the biggest companies have used to feed their great hunger for tech talent.": "他们的工程师团队留了下来，使他们成为大公司用来满足对科技人才巨大渴求的众多“收购式招聘”中的两家。",
  "Mumbai's April heat stroke deaths highlighted the need for more nuanced and localized warnings, researchers say.": "研究人员表示，孟买4月的中暑死亡事件凸显了需要更细致和本地化的预警。",
  "A year ago the end seemed near.": "一年前，末日似乎近在眼前。",
  "In effect, fewer federal funds today are going towards the agency's other work—such as forest conservation, watershed and cultural resources management, and infrastructure upkeep—that affect the lives of all Americans.": "实际上，如今用于该机构其他工作的联邦资金减少了——例如森林保护、流域和文化资源管理以及基础设施维护——这些工作影响着所有美国人的生活。",
  "\"If we're going to have 100-year lives, we need cars that a 90-year old can drive comfortably.\"": "“如果我们要活到100岁，我们就需要90岁老人也能舒适驾驶的汽车。”",
