  "Instead of wordy, worthy strategies, future governments need to do more to provide the conditions for sport to thrive.": "未来的政府需要做更多，而不是冗长而值得称赞的战略，来为体育繁荣创造条件。",
  "After all, four decades of evidence has now shown that corporations in Europe as well as the US are evading the meritocratic hiring and promotion of women to top positions—no matter how much \"soft pressure\" is put upon them.": "毕竟，四十年的证据已经表明，欧洲和美国的公司都在规避择优录用和提拔女性担任高层职位——无论对它们施加多少“软压力”。",
  "When the government talks about infrastructure contributing to the economy the focus is usually on roads, railways, broadband and energy.": "当政府谈论基础设施对经济的贡献时，焦点通常集中在公路、铁路、宽带和能源上。",
  "Coming at a time of fresh incentives from the UK government for landowners to grow more trees, the trade body says these don't go far enough and fail to promote the benefits of planting them to boost timber supplies.": "在英国政府近期为土地所有者提供种植更多树木的新激励措施之际，该行业机构表示这些措施还不够，未能充分宣传种植树木以增加木材供应量的益处。",
  "She started spinning off examples.": "她开始举出一连串例子。",
  "Readers of Happy Money are clearly a privileged lot, anxious about fulfilment, not hunger.": "《快乐金钱》的读者显然是一群特权阶层，他们忧虑的是自我实现，而非饥饿。",
