  "In one study of the ability she called \"thin slicing,\" the late psychologist Nalini Ambady asked participants to watch silent 10-second video clips of professors and to rate the instructor's overall effectiveness.": "在一项关于她称之为“薄片切片”能力的研究中，已故心理学家纳利尼·安巴迪要求参与者观看教授们无声的10秒视频片段，并对教师整体教学效果进行评分。",
  "State governments are well accustomed to managing forests, but traditionally they've focused on wildlife, watersheds and opportunities for recreation.": "州政府非常习惯于管理森林，但传统上他们关注的是野生动物、流域和娱乐机会。",
  "They chose this particular behavior for three reasons, according to study co-author Eric Schwitzgebel, a philosopher at the University of California, Riverside: students' attitudes on the topic are variable and unstable, behavior is easily measurable, and ethics literature largely agrees that eating less meat is good because it reduces environmental harm and animal suffering.": "根据研究合著者、加州大学河滨分校哲学家埃里克·施维茨格贝尔的说法，他们选择这一特定行为有三个原因：学生对这个话题的态度多变且不稳定，行为容易测量，而且伦理文献普遍认为少吃肉是有益的，因为它减少了对环境的危害和动物的痛苦。",
  "Other studies have shown that rebellious behavior increases as you become a teenager and then fades away as you grow older.": "其他研究表明，叛逆行为在进入青少年时期时增加，随着年龄增长而逐渐消退。",
