  "Facebook promised the European commission then that it would not link phone numbers to Facebook identities, but it broke the promise almost as soon as the deal went through.": "Facebook当时向欧盟委员会承诺，不会将电话号码与Facebook身份关联，但交易一完成，它几乎立刻就违背了这一承诺。",
  "Customers in the past nearly always paid tips after receiving a service, such as at the conclusion of a restaurant meal, after getting a haircut or once a pizza was delivered.": "过去，顾客几乎总是在接受服务后付小费，例如在餐厅用餐结束时、理发后或披萨送到时。",
  "The dual aim was mixed up: The stress on success over taking part was intimidating for newcomers.": "双重目标被混淆了：强调成功而非参与，这让新手望而生畏。",
