  "There is a good reason why the UK is dominated by animal husbandry: most of its terrain doesn't have the right soil or climate to grow crops on a commercial basis.": "英国以畜牧业为主是有充分理由的：其大部分地形没有适合商业化种植农作物的土壤或气候。",
  "The causes of the UK's current position are complex and range from outdated perceptions of productive forestry to the decimation of trees by grey squirrels.": "英国目前状况的原因复杂多样，从对生产性林业的过时观念，到灰松鼠对树木的大量破坏，不一而足。",
  "This week, it asked the five most valuable US tech companies for information about their many small acquisitions over the past decade.": "本周，它要求美国五家最具价值的科技公司提供过去十年间众多小型收购的相关信息。",
  "So, to increase employee wages without raising prices, more employers are succumbing to the temptations of tip creep and tipflation.": "因此，为了在不提高价格的情况下增加员工工资，越来越多的雇主正屈服于小费蔓延和小费通胀的诱惑。",
  "A growing number seem to agree.": "越来越多的人似乎同意这一点。",
  "Critics make three main arguments against gene patents: a gene is a product of nature, so it may not be patented; gene patents suppress innovation rather than reward it; and patents’ monopolies restrict access to genetic tests such as Myriad’s.": "批评者对基因专利提出了三个主要论点：基因是自然的产物，因此不应被授予专利；基因专利抑制而非奖励创新；专利垄断限制了对诸如Myriad公司提供的基因检测的获取。",
  "Young adults \\\\\"really care about the planet,\\\\\" says John Brunnquell, president of Egg Innovations.": "年轻人“真的很关心地球，”鸡蛋创新公司总裁约翰·布伦奎尔说。",
  "She found that mothers who used devices during the exercise started 20 per cent fewer verbal and 39 per cent fewer nonverbal interactions with their children.": "她发现，在练习过程中使用设备的母亲与孩子的语言互动减少了20%，非语言互动减少了39%。",
  "The key messages that have been put together for World Environment Day do include a call for governments to enact legislation to curb single-use plastics.": "为世界环境日整理的关键信息确实包括呼吁各国政府立法限制一次性塑料制品。",
  "This practice was justified by the claim that women were needed at home, and it kept juries unrepresentative of women through the 1960s.": "这种做法以“家里需要女性”为由被证明是合理的，并且这使得陪审团在20世纪60年代一直缺乏女性代表性。",
  "Another approach to getting more done in less time is to rethink how you prioritise your day—in particular how we craft our to-do lists.": "另一种在更短时间内完成更多工作的方法是重新思考如何安排一天的优先事项，特别是如何制定待办事项清单。",
  "These designers came to exert enormous influence on the course of American architecture, but none more so than Mies.": "这些设计师对美国建筑的发展方向产生了巨大影响，但没有人能比得上密斯。",
  "Local officials are using the levers that are available to them to safeguard residents' health in the face of a serious threat.": "面对严重威胁，地方官员正在利用他们可用的手段来保护居民的健康。",
  "\"For decades we have not taken responsibility for investing in our domestic wood supply, leaving us exposed to fluctuating prices and fighting for future supplies of wood as global demand rises and our own supplies fall.\" The UK has ideal conditions for growing wood to build low-carbon homes and is a global leader in certifying that its forests are sustainably managed, Confor says.": "“几十年来，我们一直没有承担投资国内木材供应的责任，导致我们暴露在价格波动之下，并在全球需求上升而自身供应下降时争夺未来的木材供应。”康福尔组织表示，英国拥有种植木材以建造低碳房屋的理想条件，并且在认证其森林可持续管理方面处于全球领先地位。",
  "Of course, it is not like you can take an unemployed waiter and train him to be a doctor in a few weeks, no matter who pays for it.": "当然，你不可能把一个失业的服务员在几周内培训成医生，无论谁为此买单。",
  "It gains Microsoft broad rights to the data inputted or outputted by any user—rights to use this data in any way it sees fit; it can even share it with third parties.": "这使微软获得了对任何用户输入或输出数据的广泛权利——以任何其认为合适的方式使用这些数据的权利；甚至可以与第三方共享。",
  "They were impressionable kids during the crash of 2008, when many of their parents lost their jobs or their life savings or both.": "他们在2008年经济危机时还是易受影响的青少年，当时他们的许多父母失去了工作或毕生积蓄，或两者兼失。",
  "We need progressive policies that shape collective action (and rein in polluting businesses), alongside engaged citizens pushing for change.": "我们需要能够塑造集体行动（并约束污染企业）的进步政策，同时需要积极参与的公民推动变革。",
  "If you're not convinced of the inherent value in taking a year off to explore interests, then consider its financial impact on future academic choices.": "如果你不相信花一年时间探索兴趣的内在价值，那么考虑一下它对未来学业选择的经济影响。",
  "Each meeting was packed.": "每次会议都座无虚席。",
  "Companies had won patents for isolated DNA for decades—by 2005 some 20% of human genes were patented.": "几十年来，公司一直为分离的DNA获得专利——到2005年，大约20%的人类基因已获得专利。",
  "But they certainly will reshape it, and all the more so the longer they extend.": "但它们肯定会重塑它，而且持续时间越长，重塑程度就越大。",
