  "The whirlwind that swept through newsrooms harmed everybody, but much of the damage has been concentrated in areas where newspapers are least distinctive.": "席卷新闻编辑室的旋风伤害了所有人，但大部分损害集中在报纸最缺乏特色的领域。",
