  "That seems to be the case in Sweden: When forced to furlough 90 per cent of their cabin staff, Scandinavian Airlines decided to start up a short retraining program that reskilled the laid-off workers to support hospital staff.": "瑞典的情况似乎正是如此：当被迫让90%的机舱人员休假时，斯堪的纳维亚航空公司决定启动一个短期再培训项目，将下岗员工重新培训以支援医院工作人员。",
  "The bargain is very pure: Employee puts in hours of physical or mental labor and employee draws out life-sustaining moolah.": "这种交易非常纯粹：员工投入数小时的体力或脑力劳动，员工获得维持生计的金钱。",
