  "Srini Pillay, an assistant professor of psychiatry at Harvard Medical School, believes this counterintuitive link between downtime and productivity may be due to the way our brains operate.": "哈佛医学院精神病学助理教授斯里尼·皮莱认为，休息时间与生产力之间这种反直觉的联系，可能源于我们大脑的运作方式。",
  "This proposed mandate was born of frustration.": "这项拟议的强制要求源于挫败感。",
  "However, many customers are frustrated because they feel they are being asked for too high of a tip, too often.": "然而，许多顾客感到沮丧，因为他们觉得被要求支付过高的小费，而且频率也太高。",
  "Critics make three main arguments against gene   patents: a gene is a product of nature, so it may not be patented; gene patents suppress innovation rather than reward it; and patents’ monopolies restrict access to genetic tests such as Myriad’s.": "批评者对基因专利提出了三个主要论点：基因是自然的产物，因此不应被授予专利；基因专利抑制而非奖励创新；专利垄断限制了对诸如Myriad公司提供的基因检测的获取。",
  "In our rapidly changing economy, we more than ever need people in the workplace who can take initiative and exercise their imagination \\\\\"to respond to unexpected events\\\\\".": "在我们快速变化的经济中，我们比以往任何时候都更需要工作场所中那些能够主动采取行动并发挥想象力“应对意外事件”的人。",
  "It can't when so many more employers have so much more access to so much more above average cheap foreign labor, cheap robotics, cheap software, cheap automation and cheap genius.": "当更多的雇主拥有更多渠道获取更多高于平均水平的廉价外国劳动力、廉价机器人技术、廉价软件、廉价自动化和廉价人才时，这是不可能实现的。",
  "Indeed, there is something a little absurd in the state getting involved in the planning of such a fundamentally \\\\\"grassroots\\\\\" concept as community sports associations.": "确实，国家介入像社区体育协会这样根本上是“草根”概念的计划，有点荒谬。",
  "That day's high temperature of roughly 36°C was 1°C shy of the heat wave alert threshold for coastal cities set by national meteorological authorities.": "当天约36°C的最高气温，比国家气象部门设定的沿海城市高温预警阈值低了1°C。",
  "America’s Federal Trade Commission launched a round of talks about how to save newspapers.": "美国联邦贸易委员会发起了一轮关于如何拯救报纸的讨论。",
  "Today, widespread social pressure to immediately go to college in conjunction with increasingly high expectations in a fast-moving world often causes students to completely overlook the possibility of taking a gap year.": "如今，社会上普遍存在的立即上大学的压力，加上快速变化的世界中日益增长的期望，常常使学生完全忽视了间隔年的可能性。",
  "So it's not surprising that people are more stressed at home.": "所以人们在家里压力更大并不令人意外。",
