  "Evidence shows that 60,000 extra new homes could be built over the next five years if the cap were lifted, increasing GDP by 0.6%.": "有证据表明，如果取消上限，未来五年内可以额外建造6万套新住房，使GDP增长0.6%。",
  "This slim volume is packed with tips to help wage slaves as well as lottery winners get the most \\\\\"happiness bang for your buck.\\\\\" It seems most people would be better off if they could shorten their commutes to work, spend more time with friends and family and less of it watching television (something the average American spends a whopping two months a year doing, and is hardly jollier for it).": "这本薄薄的书里满是建议，帮助工薪族和彩票中奖者从花出的每一分钱中获得最大的“幸福回报”。看来，如果大多数人能缩短通勤时间，花更多时间与朋友和家人在一起，少看电视（普通美国人平均每年花整整两个月看电视，却并未因此更快乐），他们的生活可能会更好。",
  "Accommodating this new world of people in motion will require new attitudes on both sides of the immigration battle.": "适应这个人员流动的新世界，需要移民之争双方都采取新的态度。",
  "As this new science of habit has emerged, controversies have erupted when the tactics have been used to sell questionable beauty creams or unhealthy foods.": "随着这门关于习惯的新科学兴起，当这些策略被用于销售可疑的美容霜或不健康的食品时，争议也随之爆发。",
  "Worse, the numbers are now falling at an accelerating rate.": "更糟糕的是，这些数字现在正以加速的速度下降。",
  "So then the problem is not really about technology, but rather, \\\\\"how do we innovate our institutions and our work practices?\\\\": "因此，问题实际上不在于技术本身，而在于“我们如何创新我们的制度和我们的工作方式？”",
  "To start, we can recognize the new birds of passage, those living and thriving in the gray areas.": "首先，我们可以认可那些新移民鸟，那些在灰色地带生活并茁壮成长的人。",
  "The move to renewables is picking up momentum around the world: They now account for more than half of new power sources going on line.": "向可再生能源的转变正在全球加速推进：目前可再生能源已占新增发电装机容量的一半以上。",
  "On the home front, however, people have no such clarity.": "然而，在国内方面，人们却没有如此清晰的认识。",
  "But as companies continue their attempts at personalised medicine, the courts will remain rather busy.": "但随着公司继续尝试个性化医疗，法院将仍然相当繁忙。",
