  "Aesthetic effect came from the landscape, new materials and forthright detailing.": "美学效果来自于景观、新材料和直率的细节处理。",
  "Visual recognition, reads the study, is \"an automatic psychological process, occurring rapidly and intuitively with little or no apparent conscious deliberation\".": "研究指出，视觉识别是“一种自动的心理过程，发生迅速且直观，几乎没有或明显没有有意识的思考”。",
  "The users of their services are not their customers.": "他们服务的用户并不是他们的客户。",
  "He gestured toward his wife and said, “She’s the talker in our family.” The room burst into laughter; the man looked puzzled and hurt.": "他指着妻子说：“她是我们家的话匣子。”房间里爆发出笑声；那人看起来困惑又受伤。",
  "These habits have helped companies earn billions of dollars when customers eat snacks or wipe counters almost without thinking, often in response to a carefully designed set of daily cues.": "这些习惯帮助公司在顾客几乎不假思索地吃零食或擦柜台时赚取了数十亿美元，而这些行为往往是对精心设计的一系列日常提示的反应。",
