  "California is leading the way, as it does on so many climate efforts, in figuring out the details.": "加州正在像其在众多气候行动中那样，率先探索具体细节。",
  "Customers now routinely see menus of suggested default options—often well above 20% of what they owe.": "现在，顾客经常看到建议默认选项的菜单——通常远高于他们应付金额的20%。",
  "Every Saturday morning, at 9 am, more than 50,000 runners set off to run 5km around their local park.": "每周六早上9点，超过5万名跑步者出发，在当地的公园周围跑5公里。",
  "Firms are now studying how genes interact, looking for correlations that might be used to determine the causes of disease or predict a drug’s efficacy.": "公司现在正在研究基因如何相互作用，寻找可能用于确定疾病原因或预测药物疗效的相关性。",
  "A move back to self-sufficiency, the argument goes, would boost the farming industry, political sovereignty and even the nation's health.": "有人认为，回归自给自足将促进农业产业、政治主权乃至国民健康。",
  "Snap decisions can be important defense mechanisms; if we are judging whether someone is dangerous, our brains and bodies are hard-wired to react very quickly, within milliseconds.": "快速决策可以是重要的防御机制；如果我们在判断某人是否危险，我们的大脑和身体会本能地在几毫秒内做出极快的反应。",
  "\\\\\"You have the importation of terminology that historically used to be associated with non-profit organizations and religious organizations: terms like vision, values, passion, and purpose,\\\\\" said Khurana.": "“你看到了术语的引入，这些术语历史上曾与非营利组织和宗教组织联系在一起：如愿景、价值观、激情和使命等词汇，”库拉纳说。",
  "The current downturn in the art market is the worst since the Japanese stopped buying Impressionists at the end of 1989.": "当前艺术品市场的低迷，是自1989年底日本人停止购买印象派作品以来最严重的一次。",
  "The Silver Room Block Party, staged by Hyde Park community leader Eric Williams, announced it would not return in 2024.": "由海德公园社区领袖埃里克·威廉姆斯举办的“银屋街区派对”宣布将不会在2024年回归。",
  "Unfortunately, many people who are opting to work in retirement are preparing to do so because they are worried about making ends meet in their later years, said Brent Weiss, a co-founder at   Baltimore-based financial-planning firm Facet Wealth.": "总部位于巴尔的摩的理财规划公司Facet Wealth的联合创始人布伦特·韦斯表示，不幸的是，许多选择在退休后继续工作的人之所以这样做，是因为他们担心晚年难以维持生计。",
  "With or without permission, they straddle laws, jurisdictions and identities with ease.": "无论有无许可，他们都能轻松地跨越法律、司法管辖区和身份界限。",
