  "The communities minister, Don Foster, has hinted that George Osborne, Chancellor of the Exchequer, may introduce more flexibility to the current cap on the amount that local authorities can borrow against their housing stock debt.": "社区事务大臣唐·福斯特暗示，财政大臣乔治·奥斯本可能会对地方政府目前可借入的住房存量债务上限引入更大的灵活性。",
  "\"The human systems and the landscapes we live on are linked, and the interactions go both ways,\" he says.": "人类系统和我们所生活的景观是相互关联的，而且这种相互作用是双向的，”他说。",
  "John Gottman, the marriage expert, explains that we quickly \"thin slice\" information reliably only after we ground such snap reactions in \"thick sliced\" long-term study.": "婚姻专家约翰·戈特曼解释说，只有当我们把这种快速反应建立在\"厚切片\"的长期研究基础上时，我们才能可靠地快速\"薄切片\"信息。",
  "What WhatsApp offered Facebook was an intricate and finely detailed web of its users' friendships and social lives.": "WhatsApp为Facebook提供的是一张关于用户友谊和社交生活的错综复杂且细致入微的关系网。",
