  "But in other places, nighttime temperatures or humidity might be as important a gauge of risk as daytime highs.": "但在其他地方，夜间温度或湿度可能与白天的最高气温一样，是衡量风险的重要指标。",
  "The Wickquasgeck Trail is an example of a historical desire path, created by Native Americans to cross the forests of Manhattan and move between settlements quickly.": "威克瓦斯克小道是一条历史性欲望小径的例证，由美洲原住民开辟，用于穿越曼哈顿的森林并在定居点之间快速移动。",
  "There are some indications that it is preparing to do just that.": "有一些迹象表明，它正准备这样做。",
