  "We recommend using real grass because of its   environmental benefits, which include supporting wildlife, alleviating flooding and cooling the environment.\\\\\" The RHS's decision comes as campaigners try to raise awareness of the problems fake grass causes.": "我们推荐使用真草，因为它具有环境效益，包括支持野生动物、缓解洪水和降低环境温度。”皇家园艺学会的决定出台之际，活动人士正试图提高人们对假草所造成问题的认识。",
