  "It is far better to spend money on experiences,   say Ms Dunn and Mr Norton, like interesting trips, unique meals or even going to the cinema.": "邓恩女士和诺顿先生表示，把钱花在体验上要好得多，比如有趣的旅行、独特的餐食，甚至去看电影。",
  "Existing health privacy law is primarily focused on the way hospitals, doctors' offices, clinics and insurance companies store health records online.": "现有的健康隐私法主要关注医院、医生办公室、诊所和保险公司在线存储健康记录的方式。",
